- Annoys me?

00:00:30.002 --> 00:00:32.590
- Yeah, like while, during that yeah.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.131
- Kelly takes the longest, yeah.

00:00:34.131 --> 00:00:35.490
(audience laughs)

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.470
And I know this because she just starts,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.277
well she has the gift
of gab as you all know.

00:00:39.277 --> 00:00:40.110
(audience laughs)

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.845
So she just starts talking really fast.

00:00:41.845 --> 00:00:42.995
- He takes long too!

00:00:42.995 --> 00:00:44.445
- And then she starts sweating profusely.

00:00:44.445 --> 00:00:45.307
(audience laughs)

00:00:45.307 --> 00:00:46.140
You're a sweater.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.460
- No, I do sweat, I get so
sweaty 'cause I'm nervous!

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.400
'cause I don't want them to home.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.611
He, you take long too,
- I don't even have

00:00:52.611 --> 00:00:53.590
You just take forever
to finish your sentence.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:54.940
- I don't even have really a thought.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.432
So how can I, how can I,
- Whatever!

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:59.098
- How can I take a long
time to say anything?

00:00:59.098 --> 00:00:59.931
- Whatever!

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:00.764
- The hardest part we deal with--

00:01:00.764 --> 00:01:01.597
- [Brie] I do have a second
question for you guys.

00:01:01.597 --> 00:01:03.050
- Sorry.
- Okay, okay.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:06.190
- Um, so girls especially,
so I know we can't really

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:08.480
see your feet while you guys
are like taping the show,

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.260
so do you guys like wear your shoes

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:12.460
'cause I know I wouldn't,
'cause I hate shoes.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.210
