00:01:17.019 --> 00:01:18.030
(audience laughs)

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:19.331
- I'm down, we'll be barefoot together.

00:01:19.331 --> 00:01:20.480
- I am so uncomfortable!

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.725
That's good to know that nobody's sees it.

00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:23.970
