being shown the whole time.

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:27.085
(audience laughs)

00:01:27.085 --> 00:01:28.270
So, that sucks.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:29.383
- See? We are so different.

00:01:29.383 --> 00:01:31.630
- I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.110
- Waste of thousands of
dollars you've wasted.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:34.390
(audience cheers)

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:37.646
- What these old things?
- Exactly! All right!

00:01:37.646 --> 00:01:39.307
- Hundreds of thousands of dollars wasted.

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:43.010
- Exactly. Next, Davion where you at?

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.140
